      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinebluff%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Lincoln Park School and McLeod Family Rural Complex in Pinebluff are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
